## Teaching outbound mail

For the Teaching repo, **all agent/ops emails** go to **`teaching@goapptivity.com`** unless the user names a different address for that send.

## Do not

- Substitute FAB owner emails (`mkunzler@gmail.com`, product owner addresses) unless the user asked for that identity.
- Use `support@`, `tickets@`, `hello@`, or `noreply@` as the developer contact unless explicitly requested.
- Fall back to `admin1@goapptivity.com` for Teaching — use `teaching@goapptivity.com`.
- Invent a domain for other products without a recorded domain — use `admin1@goapptivity.com`.
